# An allowlist, not a denylist. Everything is excluded and only what the build
# reads is let back in, so a file nobody thought about — `.env.local` above all,
# but also `node_modules` from another platform or a stale `.next` — cannot reach
# the build context, let alone a layer of a pushed image.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!next.config.ts
!postcss.config.mjs
!public/
!src/
